[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7980.069, "timestamp": "02:13:00", "text": "所以，趁着它还在煎炸的时候，我们来剥皮吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7982.79, "timestamp": "02:13:02", "text": "这些西红柿。把皮剥掉就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7985.27, "timestamp": "02:13:05", "text": "呃，是吗？但是这只鸡应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7987.91, "timestamp": "02:13:07", "text": "更稀一些。你想把……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7990.31, "timestamp": "02:13:10", "text": "亲爱的，给我来点鸡肉吗？是的。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7991.51, "timestamp": "02:13:11", "text": "说到烹饪鸡肉，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7992.87, "timestamp": "02:13:12", "text": "我们只会做大约8到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7995.03, "timestamp": "02:13:15", "text": "10分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7998.31, "timestamp": "02:13:18", "text": "看起来像炸黄油鸡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8003.83, "timestamp": "02:13:23", "text": "等等，我刚才是不是吃了黄油鸡？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8004.79, "timestamp": "02:13:24", "text": "不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8008.069, "timestamp": "02:13:28", "text": "你从来没吃过黄油鸡吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8010.229, "timestamp": "02:13:30", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8014.149, "timestamp": "02:13:34", "text": "它长什么样来着？黄油。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8021.43, "timestamp": "02:13:41", "text": "哦，是的。看起来像黄色，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8025.27, "timestamp": "02:13:45", "text": "比如橙子咖喱。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8027.35, "timestamp": "02:13:47", "text": "是的。是的。是的。我吃过那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8035.99, "timestamp": "02:13:55", "text": "好的，他放的是白色。你不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8037.589, "timestamp": "02:13:57", "text": "应该用腰果酱"}]